  "notes": "One earned-income-credit answer. The fact is required when the remaining questions are required, when investment income is over the limit, when line 1 is at or above $68,675 while line 3 is below it, and when line 1 is at or above the 0-child completed amount while line 3 is below it and status-class is not 0. Married filing separately and head of household do not require it on that column ceiling. Yes publishes 1. No blocks. Otherwise publishes 1 without the fact."
